<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n42823" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">scaevĭtas</span></b> ,
		ātis, f.
		scaevus, II. (postclass.). <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>Awkwardness</i>, <i>perverseness</i>,
				<i>unskilfulness</i>, Gell. praef., § 20; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">6, 2, 8: artium,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Amm. 30, 4, 10</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>A mischance</i>, <i>misfortune</i>,
					<i><span class="en">App. M. 3, p. 135, 27</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">fortunae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. ib. 7</span></i>
			, p. 189, 4: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">indignae rei,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. ib. 9</span></i>
			, p. 221, 21.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
